<title>JAPAN: Sony shares jump on blue-chip demand.</title>
<headline>Sony shares jump on blue-chip demand.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sony Corp jumped on Tuesday morning, with the recent rush to buy blue-chip issues continuing to push up the multinational firm's share price, traders said.</p>
<p>Sony's shares gained 50 yen to 7,750 yen by 0144 GMT, on volume of 788,700 shares.</p>
